<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>YOUCAT Vibe — 青年教理 AI 伦理向导</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --yellow: #FDC614;
    --yellow-light: #FFE899;
    --yellow-pale: #FFF8DC;
    --black: #1a1a1a;
    --gray: #666;
    --gray-light: #999;
    --white: #fff;
    --radius: 16px;
    --shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: "Noto Serif SC", "Source Han Serif SC", "Songti SC", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--black);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1.8;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  /* ── Header Bar ── */
  .top-bar {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--yellow);
    padding: 10px 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--black);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ── Hero / Logo ── */
  .hero {
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero .logo-icon {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--black);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(253,198,20,0.35);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--black);
  }
  .hero .subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--gray-light);
    margin-top: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ── Daily Quote ── */
  .quote-card {
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 90%;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    background: var(--yellow-pale);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .quote-card .quote-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--gray-light);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .quote-card .quote-text {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .quote-card .quote-source {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gray-light);
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ── Chat Container ── */
  .chat-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    width: 92%;
    margin: 36px auto 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  /* ── Messages ── */
  .messages {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    min-height: 200px;
    max-height: 55vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 8px 4px;
  }
  .messages::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  .messages::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #e0e0e0; border-radius: 2px; }

  .msg {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease;
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .msg.user { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
  .msg.user .bubble { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); border-radius: 20px 4px 20px 20px; }
  .msg.bot  .bubble { background: #f5f5f5; color: var(--black); border-radius: 4px 20px 20px 20px; }

  .msg .avatar {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .msg .avatar svg {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;
  }

  .msg .bubble {
    max-width: 80%;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* ── Typing Indicator ── */
  .typing { display: none; }
  .typing.active { display: flex; }
  .typing .dots span {
    display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%; background: #ccc;
    animation: bounce 1.2s infinite;
  }
  .typing .dots span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .15s; }
  .typing .dots span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .3s; }
  @keyframes bounce {
    0%,60%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    30% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  }

  /* ── Input Area ── */
  .input-area {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 28px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .input-area:focus-within { border-color: var(--yellow); background: var(--white); }

  .input-area input {
    flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent;
    font-size: 15px; padding: 10px 16px; outline: none;
    font-family: inherit; color: var(--black);
  }
  .input-area input::placeholder { color: #bbb; }

  .input-area button {
    width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: none; background: var(--yellow);
    font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: var(--black);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .input-area button:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(253,198,20,0.4); }
  .input-area button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; transform: none; box-shadow: none; }

  /* ── Suggested questions ── */
  .suggestions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .suggestions button {
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1.5px solid #e0e0e0;
    background: var(--white);
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    color: var(--gray);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .suggestions button:hover {
    border-color: var(--yellow);
    background: var(--yellow-pale);
    color: var(--black);
  }

  /* ── Footer ── */
  .footer {
    margin: 48px 0 28px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #ccc;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .hero { margin-top: 32px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 22px; }
    .quote-card { padding: 20px; }
    .quote-card .quote-text { font-size: 15px; }
    .msg .bubble { max-width: 85%; font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="top-bar">YOUCAT · YOUTH CATECHISM</div>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="logo-icon">✝</div>
  <h1>YOUCAT Vibe</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">青年教理 · AI 伦理向导</p>
</div>

<!-- 日签箴言 -->
<div class="quote-card" id="quoteCard">
  <div class="quote-label">✦ 今日箴言 Daily Wisdom</div>
  <div class="quote-text" id="quoteText">加载中...</div>
  <div class="quote-source" id="quoteSource"></div>
</div>

<!-- 对话区 -->
<div class="chat-container">
  <div class="messages" id="messages">
    <div class="msg bot">
      <div class="avatar" data-role="bot"></div>
      <div class="bubble">
        孩子，欢迎你。我是<b>光启叔叔</b>，这里有什么我可以为你解答的吗？<br>
        信仰、伦理、人生困惑……都可以跟我聊聊。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 打字动画 -->
  <div class="msg bot typing" id="typing">
    <div class="avatar" data-role="bot"></div>
    <div class="bubble dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 输入框 -->
  <div class="input-area">
    <input type="text" id="questionInput" placeholder="输入你的问题..."
           autocomplete="off" autofocus>
    <button id="sendBtn" title="发送">➤</button>
  </div>

  <!-- 推荐问题 -->
  <div class="suggestions">
    <button data-q="天主真的存在吗？">天主真的存在吗？</button>
    <button data-q="祈祷的时候应该说什么？">祈祷的时候应该说什么？</button>
    <button data-q="如何面对生活中的痛苦？">如何面对生活中的痛苦？</button>
    <button data-q="天主教怎么看婚前同居？">天主教怎么看婚前同居？</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="footer">「你的话是我脚步前的明灯，是我路途上的光明」—— 圣咏 119:105</div>

<script>
